    interp_private_names_selfhost_check_2026-11-09, P2, blocked, "Self-hosted compiler lacks the private-fn cross-module visibility error that the seed interpreter now enforces (and must carry the same test/** caller exemption: white-box tests may use private names of the module under test; src/** stays strict)", src/compiler/10.frontend, 0, doc/08_tracking/bug/interp_private_names_leak_across_modules_2026-11-05.md, 2026-11-09, 2026-11-09, true

